{
  "assessment": "The change modifies `due_dates` in `worksched/sla.py` to iterate through due dates and push them forward until they fall on a weekday that is not marked as closed by the `closures` module, satisfying the requirement for open-day reporting. It introduces an import of `businessdays` which remains unused, and implements a manual day-by-day loop instead of utilizing the imported business logic library. This addresses the reported issue where tickets were landing on holidays or weekends but does so with inefficient logic and dead code.",
  "findings": [
