      "call": "Inspect imports of worksched/sla.py",
      "defect": "Unused Import: The module imports `businessdays` but never calls any functions from it. This is dead code that should be removed to keep dependencies clean and avoid confusion about whether business day rules are actually being applied.",
      "expected": "Imports should only include used modules."
    },
    {
      "actual": "Logic in `due_dates` implements a manual loop iterating by `timedelta(days=1)` instead of using the imported `businessdays` module.",
