      "call": "Review logic in worksched/sla.py due_dates function",
      "defect": "Inefficient Manual Loop vs Library Use: The implementation uses a manual while loop to advance dates, which is inefficient for long gaps between open days and ignores the imported `businessdays` module. This module was likely intended to provide optimized or more comprehensive business day calculations (e.g., handling working Saturdays) that are not captured by the simple weekend check.",
      "expected": "Utilize available modules (`businessdays`) for date arithmetic to ensure efficiency and consistency with other system components."
    }
  ]
